[* 
core.rdn
Copyright (c) 2023-2026 Ray Den
SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT

Purpose:
Small aliases for core builtins so code can use function-call style names.

Exports:
- not : boolean negation, wraps !
- shl : integer left shift, wraps <<
- shr : integer right shift, wraps >>

Examples:
"./libs/core.rdn" load
true not call print
"\n" print
4 1 shl call print
"\n" print
8 2 shr call print

TODO: add function to get platform type

*]

not defun ! end
shl defun << end
shr defun >> end
